1
00:00:01,350 --> 00:00:04,138
This lemon took a year.

2
00:00:08,150 --> 00:00:13,733
In January, it was a small tree in a pot,
resting by a cold window.

3
00:00:14,250 --> 00:00:17,090
In March, it woke up.

4
00:00:22,323 --> 00:00:27,749
By April, 23 flowers.
The whole room smelled sweet.

5
00:00:30,850 --> 00:00:34,709
Then, 9 tiny green lemons.

6
00:00:38,750 --> 00:00:43,288
And in June,
it let almost all of them go.

7
00:00:44,050 --> 00:00:50,129
Gardeners call it the June drop.
A tree keeps only what it can carry.

8
00:00:51,450 --> 00:00:54,368
All summer, it carried one.

9
00:01:00,493 --> 00:01:04,952
When the nights turned cold,
it slowly turned gold.

10
00:01:07,250 --> 00:01:09,489
No one hurried it.

11
00:01:15,850 --> 00:01:17,802
One lemon. One year.

12
00:01:18,760 --> 00:01:21,312
And already, a new bud.
